## Table recognition (structure model + text boxes from the text recognition step).

table-unavailable-no-model = The table recognition model is not installed. Download it first (about { $size } MB).

table-unavailable-no-runtime = The onnxruntime runtime is not installed. Download it first (shared with local translation).

table-unavailable-no-worker = The table recognition component is missing: { $detail }

table-err-failed = Table recognition failed: { $detail }

table-err-no-table = No table found in the selected area.

## Markdown / HTML conversion guide (runs through a custom chat model; only the setup guide exists so far).

conversion-guide-not-configured = Markdown / HTML conversion needs a vision-capable chat model. Add one in Settings, API configuration, then pick it for image conversion.

conversion-guide-model-missing = The selected conversion model no longer exists. Pick another one in Settings.

conversion-guide-no-vision = The model "{ $name }" does not accept images. Pick a vision-capable model in Settings.

conversion-guide-ready = The model "{ $name }" is set up, but model conversion is not available yet.

## Recognition window: table results.

recwin-table-title = Recognized table ({ $arg1 } text blocks)

recwin-copy-markdown = Copy Markdown

recwin-copy-html = Copy HTML

recwin-convert-markdown = Convert to Markdown (model)

recwin-convert-html = Convert to HTML (model)
